    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-09",
      "text": "Seventh reauthorization of emergency rule on relocating liquor licenses: The commission approved the seventh reauthorization of the emergency rule for premises destroyed in the August 2023 wildfires.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "vp8RrdPVBC0",
        "ts": "2:00:03",
        "endTs": "2:01:36",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T23:03:59.641Z"
      },
      "body": "Liquor Control Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-09",
      "text": "The vote to reauthorize the rule was unanimous.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "JbnNdXeWXNo",
        "ts": "1:59:00",
        "endTs": "1:59:30",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T23:03:46.572Z"
      },
      "body": "Liquor Control Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-09",
      "text": "The rule covers relocation for premises destroyed as a result of the August 2023 wildfires.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "JbnNdXeWXNo",
        "ts": "1:57:56",
        "endTs": "1:58:26",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T23:03:46.572Z"
      },
      "body": "Liquor Control Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2024-11-13",
      "text": "Renewed reauthorization of the emergency rule on relocation liquor license applications: The commission approved the renewed emergency rule on relocation liquor license applications.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "ANUL26xJBj4",
        "ts": "1:44:38",
        "endTs": "1:45:36",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-15T06:35:23.973Z"
      },
      "body": "Liquor Control Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2024-11-13",
      "text": "The rule lets an applicant ask for a hearing before the commission to make its case for using a relocation application.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "ANUL26xJBj4",
        "ts": "1:43:42",
        "endTs": "1:44:46",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-15T06:35:23.973Z"
      },
      "body": "Liquor Control Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2024-11-13",
      "text": "A paragraph number six that was missing last month has been added to the rule.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "ANUL26xJBj4",
        "ts": "1:43:20",
        "endTs": "1:43:57",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-15T06:35:23.973Z"
      },
      "body": "Liquor Control Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2024-11-13",
      "text": "The commission reviewed a renewed emergency rule on liquor license relocation for premises destroyed by the August 2023 wildfires.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "ANUL26xJBj4",
        "ts": "1:42:40",
        "endTs": "1:43:19",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-15T06:35:23.973Z"
      },
      "body": "Liquor Control Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2024-10-09",
      "text": "The commission unanimously voted to defer the emergency rule item.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "V3SSqyhfcjk",
        "ts": "1:39:24",
        "endTs": "1:40:02",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-11-04T07:35:16.021Z"
      },
      "body": "Liquor Control Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2024-10-09",
      "text": "The chair suggested deferring the emergency rule to next month to see why a provision was missing.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "V3SSqyhfcjk",
        "ts": "1:37:19",
        "endTs": "1:37:50",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-11-04T07:35:16.021Z"
      },
      "body": "Liquor Control Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2024-10-09",
      "text": "Commissioners found a sixth provision they had added was missing.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "V3SSqyhfcjk",
        "ts": "1:36:55",
        "endTs": "1:37:25",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-11-04T07:35:16.021Z"
      },
      "body": "Liquor Control Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2024-10-09",
      "text": "A commissioner said many restaurant and bar operators had to change how they do business because of the fires.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "V3SSqyhfcjk",
        "ts": "1:33:49",
        "endTs": "1:34:19",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-11-04T07:35:16.021Z"
      },
      "body": "Liquor Control Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2024-10-09",
      "text": "A commissioner said the wildfire relocation rule's wording, 'destroyed or rendered inoperable,' is too narrow.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "V3SSqyhfcjk",
        "ts": "1:33:35",
        "endTs": "1:34:05",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-11-04T07:35:16.021Z"
      },
      "body": "Liquor Control Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2024-10-09",
      "text": "The director said the rule must come back each time the governor's emergency proclamation expires and is renewed.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "V3SSqyhfcjk",
        "ts": "1:32:13",
        "endTs": "1:32:48",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-11-04T07:35:16.021Z"
      },
      "body": "Liquor Control Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2024-10-09",
      "text": "The commission is reviewing the renewal of an emergency rule for relocating liquor licenses from premises destroyed by the August 2023 wildfires.",
